    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Blue Sky Property are delighted to bring to the market this recently renovated two-bedroom first-floor property, ideally located in Seatown, Dundalk Co. Louth.\r\n\r\nThe property benefits from its own private front door entrance, providing the feel and privacy of a house while offering convenient first-floor accommodation\r\n\r\nThe property has been upgraded to provide comfortable and modern accommodation and benefits from a newly fitted kitchen, gas-fired central heating and a balcony.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation comprises a bright living area, modern kitchen, two bedrooms and bathroom accommodation. The property is presented in excellent condition following recent renovation and would make an ideal first-time purchase, investment property or home for those looking for a low-maintenance property close to Dundalk town centre. \r\n\r\nThe balcony provides a pleasant additional outdoor space, while the property's central location offers easy access to a wide range of local amenities, shops, restaurants, schools and transport links.\r\n\r\n\r\nBlue Sky Property and their servants or agents assume no responsibility for and give no guarantees, undertakings or warranties concerning the accuracy, completeness or up to date nature of the information and do not accept any liability whatsoever arising from any errors or omissions. The information does not constitute or form part of a contract and cannot be relied on as a representation of fact. Subject to contract / contract denied. Please note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate, and photographs provided for guidance only."
      },
